# 与框架仓库同一份口径：入库 LF、签出也 LF，二进制不许被"修复"行尾。
# 不写这条的话 Windows 上 core.autocrlf 会把 rustfmt 产物改成 CRLF，
# 两个仓库同一个插件源码就出现两种行尾，diff 全是空白噪声。
* text=auto eol=lf

*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.sqlite binary
*.db binary

*.yml text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.rs text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
